Package: ucspi-ssl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ucspi-tcp | ucspi-tcp-ipv6
Description: SSL/TLS client and server tools for UCSPI
 ucspi-ssl provides sslserver and sslclient, command-line tools for
 building SSL/TLS-aware TCP client-server applications using the UCSPI
 interface.  It is commonly used to add TLS support to qmail SMTP and
 POP3 services.
 .
 This package is the fehcom.de maintained fork by Erwin Hoffman,
 supporting OpenSSL 3.x and TLS 1.3.
